# Place your Qdrant collection snapshots here
#
# This directory should contain your Qdrant collections with concept embeddings
# Collections in this directory will be automatically loaded during container startup
#
# To build the collections, see ../README.md for instructions on running build_collections.py
#
# After building, copy the Qdrant storage directory here:
#   cp -r /path/to/qdrant/storage/* ./
#
# The directory structure should look like:
#   collections/
#     meddra/
#     synonyms/
#     .qdrant-initialized (or similar Qdrant metadata files)
